5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. Before we rank these proposals, I’d like to understand what actually happened to past awards.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We must verify current technical capacity before committing funds. Who is actually available to run these projects?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I’m concerned about the shared infrastructure. If the facilities are already strained, adding another major project could cause bottlenecks for everyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’m curious why the headline grant size stays constant while its real purchasing power fluctuates. Which costs does the agency still absorb centrally?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about non-scientific delays. Where do projects usually get interrupted? I’d like to check incident logs and closeout files.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Midori, your instinct is sound. I am also reviewing the closeout files to see which finished awards truly delivered on their promises.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I am checking staffing rolls and secondment minutes. I need to know who is actually here to do the work, not just who is on paper.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I am examining accreditation and bookings at shared facilities. I need to know if the spare capacity we rely on is actually available or already overcommitted.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll check the ledgers and the national computing agreement. I need to see exactly which costs the agency still covers versus what lands on the awardee.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I’ll look into incident logs on shared instrumentation and station records from partner field sites. I want to see where work actually gets interrupted.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I am also reviewing the portfolio review of schedule overruns. I want to see which types of projects tend to stall and why.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am also reviewing the national repository deposit turnaround. I need to know if data release delays will bottleneck the project timeline.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I am also checking the national computing agreement. I need to verify if simulation costs are truly covered, as that dictates our computational feasibility.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll also check the portfolio review of schedule overruns. I need to see if the delays correlate with the shifting cost burdens I suspect.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll also check the national repository deposit turnaround. I want to ensure data release won’t stall the project timeline.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I’ll also check the national repository deposit turnaround. I want to ensure data release won’t stall the project timeline.""}]}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I’ll also check the closeout files of finished awards. I want to see which confident picks quietly stalled while plainer ones kept earning their keep.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am also checking the staffing rolls for technical posts. I need to confirm if the trained hands we rely on are still here or gone.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Ryuji"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Ryuji: I am also checking the staffing rolls for technical posts. I need to confirm if the trained hands we rely on are still here or gone.""}]}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I am also checking the incident logs on shared instrumentation. I need to know if equipment failures are already straining our shared resources.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll also check the staffing rolls. I need to see if the technical capacity matches the financial reality I’m uncovering.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
